Like if something
bothers him twice,

00:27:26.770 --> 00:27:29.680
he's scripting up a
solution to it that weekend.

00:27:29.680 --> 00:27:32.590
And so he has this
whole automated Apps

00:27:32.590 --> 00:27:34.630
Script that he has
that anytime he

00:27:34.630 --> 00:27:36.850
gets an email from
his child's daycare,

00:27:36.850 --> 00:27:39.130
because they email pictures,
but the pictures are only

00:27:39.130 --> 00:27:41.385
saved for 24 hours or whatever.

00:27:41.385 --> 00:27:43.510
So anytime he gets an email
from his child daycare,

00:27:43.510 --> 00:27:46.090
it triggers this script,
it takes the photo,

00:27:46.090 --> 00:27:48.790
it copies it and saves it
locally into his drive,

00:27:48.790 --> 00:27:50.200
and then he has
this album that's

00:27:50.200 --> 00:27:53.770
just all of the photos
of his kids in daycare

00:27:53.770 --> 00:27:56.505
from daily update
emails that were just

00:27:56.505 --> 00:27:58.380
meant to be like, hey
guess what, they didn't

00:27:58.380 --> 00:27:59.950
choke on a Cheeto or whatever.

00:27:59.950 --> 00:28:01.130
I don't know what kids do.

00:28:01.130 --> 00:28:03.340
Then you could see
a natural extension

00:28:03.340 --> 00:28:06.610
