recognition kind of APIs

00:28:11.680 --> 00:28:13.210
to make this
something more useful,

00:28:13.210 --> 00:28:16.030
or to collate it, or to grab the
best ones for like the holiday

00:28:16.030 --> 00:28:17.170
Christmas card.

00:28:17.170 --> 00:28:18.850
But this is just
like one guy who's

00:28:18.850 --> 00:28:21.760
like, why do these emails keep
deleting, and he just fixes it.

00:28:21.760 --> 00:28:23.340
And it didn't take
him long at all.

00:28:23.340 --> 00:28:25.590
And that's the kind of thing
I love about Apps Script,

00:28:25.590 --> 00:28:27.370
